{"symbol":"NPFL","yahoo":"NPFL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Neopolitan Pizza and Foods Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Food Distribution","website":"https://www.neopolitanpizza.in","about":"Neopolitan Pizza and Foods Limited primarily engages in the agricultural commodities trading business. The company operates in two segments: Quick Service Restaurant and Agricultural Commodities Trading. The Quick Service Restaurant segment offers pizzas, including vegetarian and gluten-free options, along with a broader Italian menu (soups, salads, pasta, desserts under the Neopolitan Pizza brand name.  The Agricultural Commodities Trading segment offers wheat, rice, fruits, and vegetables, tomatoes, onions, and apples on a wholesale basis. Neopolitan Pizza and Foods Limited was formerly known as Neopolitan Pizza Limited and changed its name to Neopolitan Pizza and Foods Limited in July 2024. Neopolitan Pizza and Foods Limited was incorporated in 2011 and is based in Vadodara, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:44:59+00:00","quote":{"price":7.0,"prevClose":7.0,"marketCap":11.9,"high52":13.2,"low52":5.88,"pe":58.33,"bookValue":18.83,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":0.72,"shares":1.7,"insiders":65.19,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-10-09","2024-10-10","2024-10-11","2024-10-14","2024-10-15","2024-10-16","2024-10-17","2024-10-18","2024-10-21","2024-10-22","2024-10-23","2024-10-24","2024-10-25","2024-10-28","2024-10-29","2024-10-30","2024-10-31","2024-11-01","2024-11-04","2024-11-05","2024-11-06","2024-11-07","2024-11-08","2024-11-11","2024-11-12","2024-11-13","2024-11-14","2024-11-18","2024-11-19","2024-11-21","2024-11-22","2024-11-25","2024-11-26","2024-11-27","2024-11-28","2024-11-29","2024-12-02","2024-12-03","2024-12-04","2024-12-05","2024-12-06","2024-12-09","2024-12-10","2024-12-11","2024-12-12","2024-12-13","2024-12-16","2024-12-17","2024-12-18","2024-12-19","2024-12-20","2024-12-23","2024-12-24","2024-12-26","2024-12-27","2024-12-30","2024-12-31",